Report which subscription account each native agent started with.

The deployment's claude and codex wrappers record the account from Settings ->
Subscriptions that a Claude Code or Codex process signs in with, in an
omnigent-subscription file: the bridge directory for Claude, the session's
CODEX_HOME for Codex. omnigent/native/subscription_record.py reads it and posts
it as external_session_usage data.subscription, the account ID or "default" for
the deployment's own login, whenever it changes. claude-native checks on every
statusLine render; codex-native when it subscribes to a thread and at each turn
start. Pairs with the server patch 0014-session-subscription.patch and the web
patch 0018-composer-subscription.patch. Applies after
0009-stop-codex-process.patch. Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

